              "alt": "A scored round sourdough loaf"
            },
            "name": "Country sourdough",
            "price": "$9",
            "text": "<p>Our everyday loaf. Three-day ferment, blistered crust, a soft and tangy crumb.</p>",
            "tag": ""
          }
